        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1-2-4 Effective January 1, 1977, Warren Occupational Technical Center teachers who do not have a degree shall have $120 added to their annual salary for each twenty (20) semester hours, up to eighty (80) semester hours. Hours must be related to their teaching assignment or normal requirements for a BA degree.",
